<title>SINGAPORE: UPP says Kotjo sells 9.7 mln UPP shares.</title>
<headline>UPP says Kotjo sells 9.7 mln UPP shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packaging company United Pulp and Paper Ltd (UPP) said on Thursday Johanes Kotjo had sold 9.7 million of the company's shares at Singapore $1.50 each.</p>
</text>
